<dl v-else-if="position.calculation" class="summary-values"><div><dt>已記錄成交股數</dt><dd>{{ position.calculation.quantity }} 股</dd></div><div><dt>平均成本</dt><dd>{{ position.calculation.average_cost }} {{ position.calculation.currency }}</dd></div></dl>
<p v-else>尚無持倉畫面；只保存已提供的證據或決定。</p>
